{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1508066-finding-the-tiers-in-cofd","id":1508066,"title":"Finding the Tiers in CofD","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-04-11T13:07:46-07:00","id":1508066,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Finding the Tiers in CofD","content":"Hunter the Vigil introduced the concept of Tiers in CofD. <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/88846/The-Danse-Macabre?affiliate_id=321987\" target=\"_blank\">The Danse Macabre</a> brought explained how tiers can work for Vampire the Requiem, and <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/82216/Mage-Chroniclers-Guide?affiliate_id=321987\" target=\"_blank\">Mage Chronicler's Guide</a> did the same for Mage the Awakening. Does any other of the CofD systems use the concept of tiers? Maybe tiers don't mesh as well with the other games?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27293-cabaal","name":"Cabaal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27293_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"41"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-11T17:22:11-07:00","id":1508088,"title":"","content":"Ish?<br /> <br /> The main use of tiers is soft context for the nature of and form of organizations in the world of Chronicles and for laying out the scale of conflict for story seeds where it would be helpful to see it laid out, providing a tool for players to quickly describe what sort of story they want and allows them to understand the resources they might have in conjunction with that.<br /> <br /> It's wibbly, though. Some gamelines, namely Mage and Mummy (and take note their roles as the top two most powerful splats in Chronicles), explicitly break the Tier structure in terms of layout*, while many softly play to the rules of Tiers but then kind of just casually forget about them when you get into particulars. As useful as a tool as it is for designing and looking at the world with, time and tide has revealed it's limitations as a universally useful lens. It's still useful for marking up ideas for how big a Chronicle is or can be, though, so it's mianly persevered through it's story seed implementation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-12T13:16:05-07:00","id":1508184,"title":"","content":"Deviant has threat tiers which tie directly into the power levels of PCs if that is what you are talking about.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-12T13:21:57-07:00","id":1508186,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ShadowcatX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1508066-finding-the-tiers-in-cofd?p=1508184#post1508184\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Deviant has threat tiers which tie directly into the power levels of PCs if that is what you are talking about.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nah, they're talking about the Local, Regional, Global, Cosmic Tier Scale that started with Hunter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-12T13:24:32-07:00","id":1508188,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1508066-finding-the-tiers-in-cofd?p=1508186#post1508186\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Nah, they're talking about the Local, Regional, Global, Cosmic Tier Scale that started with Hunter.</div> </div> </div> </div>Aren't Deviant tiers also tied to that, local conspiracy at 1-2 going up to global at 5-6?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-12T13:32:37-07:00","id":1508192,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ShadowcatX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1508066-finding-the-tiers-in-cofd?p=1508188#post1508188\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Aren't Deviant tiers also tied to that, local conspiracy at 1-2 going up to global at 5-6?</div> </div> </div> </div>Not so much. Standing has some correlation for creating a sense of how large and affective they can be, but the actual games of Deviant don't codify chronicles according to those tiers, which is the main thing that tier system did.<br /> <br /> The Chronicles Tiers have become a foundation that lot of things have built and deviated away from, with the organizational rules being a good example of where it both persists and doesn't apply. Deviant's Threat Tiers have no statement on if your game is going to stay in one small area, or trawl around the world or maybe even the cosmos, though it <i>can</i> (doesn't automatically, mind) set the stakes at either local, regional, global, or cosmic consequences.<br /> <br /> One led to the other, but it would be a fallacy to assume they are the same because of that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}